. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZWya0uQBjdMQ7kNvwGwZ27b&_nc_oc=Adm6OrJQiNPI1LfYIQXl42vraJVzAPP42VhrY7z1N59VAUiXRFqXDpvjSNLeuyakn3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5H0aj7eAtKEbT4GfesMRxZADdky0IwfKdTJzCgz_13Q&oe=69BFE83E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2bmhWrdLui8Q7kNvwHfrGjC&_nc_oc=Adnob654j7Y8HN1yFCO2_RIB52DNGTMpVCROKW7U4PvZG1616HhM_RKz2PGnc3HYypQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxF7HBIBjqB04MV4xOBtdxRUECUA7hxRA9VsnC0m_Fa4w&oe=69BFFEDE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i9DlUlF4ME0Q7kNvwFZv4iv&_nc_oc=AdkwcB92XzkOv4pwTOhlzSDnR4tlLi6EhjO9JGkGK6Qo7K89ZvExxwyo3jRfUj3l1J0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwVJpYcjcNVk2JkIFgSZtZcgvMYG5nT8tEyWrQuSsKYjg&oe=69BFF45B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1